<title>GREECE: Greek 1M ATHIBOR edges up to 11.16pct from 11.15.</title>
<headline>Greek 1M ATHIBOR edges up to 11.16pct from 11.15.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Athens Interbank Offered Rate (Athibor) for one month edged to 11.16 from 11.15 percent and the bid rate (Athibid) firmed to 10.63 from 10.60 percent.</p>
<p>ATHIBOR</p>
<p> DATE     1-MTH   2-MTH   3-MTH   6-MTH   9-MTH   12-MTH</p>
<p> July 04  11.16   11.15   11.12   11.10   11.08   11.08</p>
<p> July 03  11.15   11.12   11.09   11.09   11.08   11.07</p>
<p> July 02  11.09   11.06   11.05   11.05   11.05   11.06</p>
<p> July 01  10.98   10.97   10.98   10.98   10.97   10.93</p>
<p> June 30  11.47   11.47   11.47   11.34   11.24   11.14</p>
<p> June 27  11.63   11.63   11.63   11.41   11.31   11.23</p>
<p> June 26  11.84   11.82   11.81   11.44   11.34   11.25</p>
<p> June 25  11.98   11.94   11.88   11.47   11.35   11.27</p>
<p>ATHIBID</p>
