<p> June 26  11.28   11.26   11.25   10.89   10.74   10.66</p>
<p> June 25  11.44   11.42   11.35   10.94   10.75   10.68</p>
<p>Note: ATHIBOR is Greece's official reference rate. It comprises 18 leading state and private banks committed to quoting their rates by 0900 GMT every day.</p>
